        "original_id": "f1188f9f-7607-551b-bc60-af8a38d3b1ee",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xinghua, Jiangsu; Jingdezhen; Taizhou; Yancheng; Yangzhou; Jiangsu; Jiangxi; Anhui; China\n- Roles: county-level city; prefecture-level city; town\n\nFacts:\n- Xinghua is a county-level city under the administration of Taizhou in Jiangsu province, China.\n- Xinghua borders Yancheng to the north and east and Yangzhou to the west.\n- Jingdezhen was previously a town and is now a prefecture-level city in northeastern Jiangxi province, China.\n- In 2007, Jingdezhen had a total population of 1,554,000.\n- Jingdezhen borders Anhui to the north.",
